---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy" description="Card Night privacy policy.">
  <div class="prose">
    <h1>Privacy</h1>
    <p>Card Night is a static website. We don't use accounts, ad trackers, or cookies, and we don't collect personal information through this site.</p>
    <p>The newsletter form isn't live yet. Right now it only opens your own email app. When we launch the newsletter, we'll update this page to name the email provider and explain how to unsubscribe. We will never sell your email.</p>
    <p>Our host (Vercel) may keep standard server logs, such as IP addresses and request times, for security and reliability.</p>
    <p>This site is written for parents. We don't knowingly collect any information from children.</p>
    <p>Last updated October 29, 2026.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
